<H1>Tolkāppiyam, Poruḷatikāram, Iḷampūraṇam,
<BR>Marapiyal (TP9)</H1>


<P>((Master file kept in: AA\AKAM\UTF2PDY\TOLK\marapu.pdy))
<P>((last modification: 2004 october 1st))


<HR>
R 65,T 5
<HR>
<H2><A NAME="_TP9_">((9. marapu iyal))</A></H2>

<P>{Z 0}
<BR>((|oṉpatāvatu))
<BR>((marapiyal))
<BR>((((112 sutras))))

<P>{C URAI}
|iv= ōttu |iv= atikārattu+ kūṟappaṭṭa poruṭku marapu|uṇarttiṉamaiyāṉ, marapiyal |eṉṉum peyarttu.

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_545">{SA TP545i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 1}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>māṟṟaruñ ciṟappiṉ marapiyal kiḷappiṟ
<li>pārppum paṟaḻum kuṭṭiyum kuruḷaiyum
<li>kaṉṟum piḷḷaiyum makavum maṟiyumeṉ 
<li>ṟoṉpatum kuḻaviyo ṭiḷamaip peyarē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|iv= ōttiṉ -uḷ |it talai+-cūttiram |eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* -ō |eṉiṉ
|iḷamai+-peyar ām -āṟu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) kuḻaviyoṭu |iv= oṉpatu* -um |iḷamai+-peyar ām|eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|itaṉ poruḷ mēl virikkiṉṟār. (1)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_546">{SA TP546i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 2}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|erutum |ēṟṟaiyum |oruttaluṅ kaḷiṟum
<li>cēvum cēvalum |iralaiyum kalaiyum
<li>mōttaiyun takarum |utaḷum |apparum
<li>pōttum kaṇṭiyum kaṭuvaṉum piṟavum
<li>yātta |āṇpāṟ peya reṉa moḻipa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. |āṇpāṟ peyar |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |āṇpāl+-peyar |iv= eṇṇappaṭṭa patiṉaintu* -um piṟa-~um ām |eṉṟavāṟu.

``piṟavum'' |eṉṟataṉāṉ |āṇ |eṉṟum viṭai |eṉṟum varuvaṉa pōlvaṉakoḷka. (2)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_547">{SA TP547i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 3}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>pēṭaiyum peṭaiyum peṭṭaiyum peṇṇum
<li>mūṭum nākuṅ kaṭamaiyum |aḷakum
<li>mantiyum pāṭṭiyum piṇaiyum piṇavum
<li>|antañ cāṉṟa paṭiyōṭu peṇṇē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. peṇpāl+-peyar |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |i+ kūṟappaṭṭa patiṉmūṉṟu* -um peṇpāṟ-peyar ām|eṉṟavāṟu. (3)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_548">{SA TP548i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 4}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|avaṟṟuḷ.
<li>pārppum piḷḷaiyum piṟappavaṟ ṟiḷamai.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ mēl |atikarikka+-paṭṭa mū-vakai+ peyarkku* -um^ciṟappu vitiyuṭaiyāka |iccūttiramutalāka varukiṉṟa cūttiraṅkaḷāṟkūṟappaṭukiṉṟaṉa.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēṟ collappaṭṭavaṟṟuṭ pārppu piḷḷai yeṉṉum |iraṇṭumpaṟavaiyi ṉiḷamaip peyar |eṉṟavāṟu.
|ivvōttiṟ cūttirattāṟ poruḷ viḷaṅkuvaṉavaṟṟiṟku|uraiyeḻutukiṉṟilam. (4)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_549">{SA TP549i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 5}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>tavaḻpavai tāmum |avaṟṟōr |aṉṉa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, |ūrvaṉavaṟṟiṟku mēṟ collappaṭṭa |iruvakai|iḷamaip peyarum |ām |eṉṟavāṟu, (5)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_550">{SA TP550i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 6}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>mūṅkā verukeli mūvari |aṇiloṭu
<li>|āṅkavai nāṉkuṅ kuṭṭik kuriya.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, |ivai nāṉkuṅ ``kuṭṭi'' |eṉṟu collappaṭum|eṉṟavāṟu.

``mūṅkā'' |eṉpatu kīri. (6)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_551">{SA TP551i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 7}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>paṟaḻeṉap paṭiṉum |uṟaḻāṇ ṭillai.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, mēṟcollappaṭṭa nālvakai ~uyirkkum|iḷamaippeyar paṟaḻ |eṉiṉum |uṟaḻcci ~illai |eṉṟavāṟu.
|eṉavē. |iraṇṭum ām |eṉṟavāṟām (7)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_552">{SA TP552i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 8}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>nāyē paṉṟi pulimuyal nāṉkum
<li>|āyuṅ kālaik kuruḷai |eṉpa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, nāymutalākac collappaṭṭa nāṉkiṉ |iḷamaippeyarkuruḷai ~eṉṟu vaḻaṅkum |eṉṟavāṟu. (8)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_553">{SA TP553i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 9}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>nariyum |aṟṟē nāṭiṉar koḷiṉē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, nariyiṉ |iḷamaip peyarum |ārāyuṅ kālattuk``kuruḷai'' |eṉappaṭum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|itu mēlaṉavaṟṟōṭu |orunikaraṉa ~āka |otāmaiyiṟ ciṟupāṉmai varumeṉṟu koḷka. (9)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_554">{SA TP554i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 10}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kuṭṭiyum paṟaḻuṅ kūṟṟavaṇ varaiyār.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. |eytātatu* eytuvittal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēṟ collappaṭ |aivakai-~uyirkkuṅ ``kuṭṭi'' ``paṟaḻ''|eṉpaṉavum |ām |eṉṟavāṟu. (10)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_555">{SA TP555i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 11}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>piḷḷaip peyarum piḻaippāṇ ṭillai
<li>koḷḷuṅ kālai nāyalaṅ kaṭaiyē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ |ituvumatu.
<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēṟkūṟipavaṟṟuḷ ``nāy'' aṉṟi |oḻintavai ``piḷḷai''|eṉṉum |iḷamai+-peyarkku |uriya |eṉṟavāṟu.
{paṉṟikkuruḷai} {paṉṟikkuṭṭi}
{paṉṟippaṟaḻ} {paṉṟippiḷḷai} |eṉavum ām.
|ēṉaiyavum |ivvāṟē |oṭṭik koḷka. (11)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_556">{SA TP556i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 12}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>yāṭuṅ kutiraiyum navviyum |uḻaiyum
<li>|ōṭum pulvāy |uḷappaṭa maṟiyē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu ``yāṭu'' mutalāka+ collappaṭṭa |aintu* uyir-um ``maṟi'' |eṉṉum |iḷamai+-peyar yeṟum |eṉṟavāṟu.
``navvi'' -- puḷḷimāṉ. (12)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_557">{SA TP557i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 13}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kōṭuvāḻ kuraṅku kuṭṭiyuṅ kūṟupa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) ``kōṭu-vāḻ kuraṅku*'' eṉpatu {?{|ūkamu}?} mucu -~um^koḷḷappaṭum.

|ummai {{|etiratu taḻī|iya |eccavummai}}. (13)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_558">{SA TP558i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 14}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>makavum piḷḷaiyum paṟaḻum pārppum
<li>|avaiyum |aṉṉa |appā lāṉa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. |itu -~um^ kuraṅkukku* uriyatu* -ōr |iyalpu|uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) ``makavu'' mutalākiya nāṉku* -um^
kuraṅkuccāti |iḷamai+-peyar ām |eṉṟavāṟu.
{kuraṅkukkuṭṭi, kuraṅkumakavu, kuraṅkuppiḷḷai, kuraṅkuppaṟaḻ,kuraṅkuppārppu}. (14)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_559">{SA TP559i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 15}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>yāṉaiyuṅ kutiraiyuṅ kaḻutaiyuṅ kaṭamaiyum
<li>māṉō ṭaintuṅ kaṉṟeṉaṟ kuriya.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu ``yāṉai'' mutalāka ``māṉ'' īṟu* āka+collappaṭṭa |aintiṉatu |iḷamai+-peyar ``kaṉṟu'' |eṉṟu varum|eṉṟavāṟu. (15)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_560">{SA TP560i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 16}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|erumaiyum maraiyum varaiyār |āṇṭē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, ``kaṉṟu*'' eṉa+ kūṟum |iḷamai+-peyar``|erumaikku*'' -um ``maraikku*'' -um |urittu |eṉṟavāṟu* ām. (16)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_561">{SA TP561i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 17}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kavariyum karākamum nikaravaṟ ṟuḷḷē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, ``kavari'' |eṉṟu collappaṭuvatum ``karākam''eṉṟu collappaṭuvatum ``kaṉṟu*'' eṉṉum peyar peṟum |eṉṟavāṟu.

``karākam'' eṉpatu karaṭi. (17)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_562">{SA TP562i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 18}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|oṭṭakam |avaṟṟō ṭoruvaḻi nilaiyum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, ``|oṭṭakam'' eṉṟu collappaṭuvatu* -um^
``kaṉṟu*'' eṉṉum peyar peṟum |eṉṟavāṟu. (18)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_563">{SA TP563i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 19}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kuñcaram peṟumē kuḻavip peyarkkoṭai.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, ``kuḻavi'' ~eṉṟum |iḷamai+-peyar yāṉai peṟum|eṉṟavāṟu. (19)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_564">{SA TP564i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 20}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|āvum |erumaiyum |atucolap paṭumē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, |āvum |erumaiyum kuḻavippeyar peṟum|eṉṟavāṟu. (20)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_565">{SA TP565i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 21}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kaṭamaiyum maraiyu mutaṉilai |oṉṟum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, {?{kaṭamāvum}?} ``marai'' -~um^ ``kuḻavi''|eṉa+ poruntum |eṉṟavāṟu. (21)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_566">{SA TP566i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 22}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kuraṅkum mucuvum |ūkamum mūṉṟum
<li>nirampa nāṭiṉ |appeyark kuriya.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, kuraṅku mutaliya mūṉṟum |ārāyuṅ kālattuk``kuḻavi+'' peyarkku* uriya |eṉṟavāṟu. (22)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_567">{SA TP567i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 23}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kuḻaviyum makavum |āyiraṇ ṭallavai
<li>kiḻava |alla makkaṭ kaṇṇē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |eṉṟatu, ``kuḻavi'' ``makavu*'' eṉṟu collappaṭṭa|iraṇṭu |iḷamaippeyar -um allāta |ēṉaiyavai makkaṭku* uriyavalla|eṉṟavāṟu. (23)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_568">{SA TP568i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 24}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>piḷḷai kuḻavi kaṉṟē pōtteṉak
<li>koḷḷavum |amaiyum |ōraṟi vuyirkkē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉṟatu, |oraṟivuyirākiya pullum maraṉum |iḷamaippeyar piḷḷaimutalākac collappaṭṭa nāṉkuṅ koḷḷavum |amaiyum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|ummai {{|etirmaṟai}} ~ākalāṉ ``kaṉṟu*'' eṉṟatu* -ē perumpāṉmai.(24)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_569">{SA TP569i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 25}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>nellum pullum nērār |āṇṭē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. |eytiyatu vilakkal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēṟkūṟappaṭṭa nāṉkiṉ |iḷamai+-peyar -um koḷḷār nellumpullumeṉa varum |oraṟivuyirkku |eṉṟavāṟu.
|ummai {{|etirmaṟai}} ~ātaliṉ mēṟcollappaṭṭa |iḷamai+-peyarkūṟa+-peṟār |eṉṟavāṟu. (25)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_570">{SA TP570i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 26}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>colliya marapiṉ |iḷamai tāṉē
<li>colluṅ kālai |avaiyala tilavē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. |iḷamaippeyarai varaiyaṟuttu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) collippōnta marapuṭaiyaṉa ~aṉṟi+ colla vēṇṭumarapu*-uṭaiyaṉavaṟṟiṟku* -um^ collumiṭattu |ivai tāmē|iḷamai+-peyar |eṉṟavāṟu.

|eṉpatu |eṉacoṉṉavāṟōveṉiṉ, parantupaṭṭavuyirttaṉmai yellām |īṇṭu|otappaṭṭaṉavalla, |eṭuttōtātaṉavaṟṟiṟku |īṇṭu |otappaṭṭa|iḷamaip peyar allatu piṟa peyar iṉmaiyiṉ, |ivaṟṟuḷ|ēṟpaṉavaṟṟōṭu kūṭṭiyuraikka |eṉṟavāṟām.

|ittuṇaiyum kūṟappaṭṭa cūttirattiṟku,
|utāraṇam
``paṟavaitam pārppuḷḷa'' (kalit. 119)
``veḷḷāṅ kurukiṉ piḷḷaiyum palavē''
`yāmaip pārppiṉ |aṉṉa'' (kuṟuṅ. 152)
`taṉpārpput tiṉṉum piṇpiṉ mutalai'' (|aiṅkuṟu. 41)
pārppu, piḷḷai piṟavum paṟappaṉa |ūrvaṉa ~ellām |ivvakai yiṉāṟkūṟapa. naṭappaṉavaṟṟuḷ, {mūṅkākkuṭṭi, mūṅkāppaṟaḻ, verukukkuṭṭi,verukuppaṟaḻ; |elikkuṭṭi, |elippaṟaḻ; |aṇiṟkuṭṭi, |aṇiṟpaṟaḻ;nāyakkuṭṭi, nāykkuruḷai; narikkuṭṭi, narikkuruḷai; narippaṟaḻ,narippiḷḷai; paṉṟikkuṭṭi, paṉṟikkuruḷai; paṉṟippaṟaḻ;paṉṟippaḷḷai; pulikkuṭṭi, pulikkuruḷai; pulippaṟaḻ;pulippiḷḷai;kurakkukkuṭṭi, kurakkumaka; kurakkuppiḷḷai, kurakkup pārppu;kurakkuppaṟaḻ, kurakkukkuḻavi}; |ūka mucu ~eṉpaṉavum |ivvāṟēkoḷka. {yāṭṭumaṟi; kutiraimaṟi, kutiraikkaṉṟu; navvimaṟi;|uḻaimaṟi; pulvāymaṟi; yāṉaikkaṉṟu; yāṉaikkuḻavi; kaḻutaikkaṉṟu;kaṭamaikkaṉṟu, kaṭamaikkuḻavi; |āṉkaṉṟu, |āṉkuḻavi;|erumaikkaṉṟu, |erumaikkuḻavi; maraikkaṉṟu, maraikkuḻavi;kavarikkaṉṟu; karākkaṉṟu; |oṭṭakakkaṉṟu; makkaṭkuḻavi,makkaṇmaka; teṅkampiḷḷai; kamukaṅkaṉṟu; karuppampōttu.}|oraṟivuyirkkaṭ kuḻavi ~eṉpatu vantavaḻik kaṇṭukoḷka.

|iṉi |avai -~allatu piṟa ~illai ~eṉṟamaiyiṉ, |oṉṟaṟku*uriyavaṟṟai |oṉṟaṟku* urittu* ākki vaḻaṅkuvaṉa ~um^ ciṟupāṉmaikoḷḷappaṭum. {kaḻutai maṟi} ~eṉpaṉavum `piḷḷai verukit kalkiraiyāki' (kuṟun. 17) |eṉṟāṟpōlavum cāṉṟōr ceyyuḷakattu varuvaṉakaṭiyappaṭā ~eṉṟavāṟu. |eṭuttōtātatu perumpāṉmai. |iṉi|eṭuttōtātaṉa: ciṅkam puli+ -pāṟpaṭum: |uṭumpu, |onti, palli|aṇiṟ -pāṟpaṭum: nāvi ~eṉpatu mūṅkāviṉ -pāṟpaṭum. piṟavum|ivvakaiyiṉ |eṟpaṉa koḷka. (26)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_571">{SA TP571i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 27}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|oṉṟaṟi vatuvē |uṟṟaṟi vatuvē
<li>|iraṇṭaṟi vatuvē |ataṉoṭu nāvē
<li>mūṉṟaṟi vatuvē |avaṟṟoṭu mūkkē
<li>nāṉkaṟi vatuvē |avaṟṟoṭu kaṇṇē
<li>|aintaṟi vatuvē |avaṟṟōṭu ceviyē
<li>|āṟaṟi vatuvē |avaṟṟoṭu maṉaṉē
<li>nēritiṉ |uṇarntōr neṟippaṭut tiṉarē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. |ulakattu+ pal= uyiraiyum |aṟiyum vakaiyāṟkūṟappaṭutalai |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |oraṟivuyir -āvatu |uṭampiṉāṉ aṟivatu;
|īraṟivuyir -āvatu |uṭampiṉāṉum vāyiṉāṉum |aṟivatu;
mūvaṟivuyir -āvatu |uṭampiṉāṉum vāyiṉāṉum mūkkiṉāṉum |aṟivatu;
nālaṟivuyir -āvatu |uṭampiṉāṉum vāyiṉāṉum mūkkiṉāṉum kaṇṇiṉāṉum|aṟivatu;
|aiyaṟivuyir -āvatu |uṭampiṉāṉum vāyiṉāṉum mūkkiṉāṉum kaṇṇiṉāṉumceviyiṉāṉum |aṟivatu;
|āṟaṟivuyir -āvatu |uṭampiṉāṉum vāyiṉāṉum mūkkiṉāṉum kaṇṇiṉāṉumceviyiṉāṉum maṉattiṉāṉum |aṟivatu,
|ivvakaiyiṉāṉ |uyir |āṟuvakaiyiṉāṉ |āyiṉa.

|ivvāṟu |aṟitalāvatu: |uṭampiṉāl veppam taṭpam vaṉmai meṉmai|aṟiyum.
nāviṉāṟ kaippu, kāḻppu, tuvarppu, |uvarppu, puḷippu, maturam|eṉpaṉa |aṟiyum.
mūkkiṉāl naṉṉāṟṟam tīyanāṟṟam |aṟiyum.
kaṇṇiṉāl veṇmai, cemmai, poṉmai, pacumai, karumai, neṭumai,kuṟumai, parumai, nērmai, vaṭṭam, kōṇam, caturam |eṉpaṉa |aṟiyum.
ceviyiṉāl |ocai vēṟupāṭum, coṟpaṭum poruḷum |aṟiyum.
maṉattiṉāl aṟiyappaṭuvatu |itupōlvaṉa vēṇṭumeṉavum, |itu ceyalvēṇṭumeṉavum, |iḵtu |ettaṉmaiyeṉavum |aṉumāṉittal.
|aṉumāṉamāvatu pukai kaṇṭavaḻi neruppuṇmai kaṭpulaṉ |aṉṟāyiṉum|ataṉkaṇ neruppu |uṇṭeṉṟu |aṉumāṉittal.
|ivvakaiyiṉāṉ |ulakiluḷḷavellām makkaṭku |aṟitalāyiṉa.
|iṉi |avaṟṟai |aṟiyum |uyirkaḷai varukiṉṟa cūttiraṅkaḷāṟ kūṟutum.(27)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_572">{SA TP572i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 28}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>pullu maraṉum |ōraṟi viṉavē
<li>piṟavum |uḷavē |akkiḷaip piṟappē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |oraṟivuyir āmāṟu ``pullum maraṉum'' |eṉṟu collappaṭṭa|iruvakai |uṭampiṉālaṟiyum; |akkiḷaippiṟappu piṟavum |uḷa|eṉṟavāṟu.

piṟa |āvaṉa koṭṭiyun tāmaraiyuṅ kaḻunīrum |eṉpaṉa.
pulleṉpatu puravayirppu |uṭaiyaṉa; marameṉpatu |akavayirppuṭaiyaṉa. |avaiyāmāṟu muṉṉark kūṟappaṭum. (28)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_573">{SA TP573i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 29}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>nantum muraḷum |īraṟi viṉavē
<li>piṟavum |uḷavē |akkiḷaip piṟappē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. |īraṟivuyir |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |īraṟivuyirāvaṉa ``nantum, muraḷum'' eṉṟu colluva;piṟavumuḷa |īraṟivuyir eṉṟavāṟu.
nantu |eṉṟataṉāl caṅku, nattai, |alaku, noḷḷai |eṉpaṉa koḷka.muraḷ |eṉṟataṉāl |ippi, kiḷiñcil, |ēral |eṉpaṉa koḷka. (29)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_574">{SA TP574i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 30}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
