</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
cūttirattāṟ poruḷ viḷaṅkum. (41)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_586">{SA TP586i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 42}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kaṭalvāḻ cuṟavum |ēṟeṉap paṭumē.
</ol>

