<li>maṟṟivai |ellām pōtteṉap paṭumē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) ``peṟṟam*'' mutalākiya |aintuḷ |āṇiṉaiyum ``pōttu*''eṉal ākum eṉṟavāṟu. (43)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_588">{SA TP588i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 44}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>nīrvāḻ cātiyum |atupeṟaṟ kuriya.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) nīruḷ vāḻum mutalai mutalāyiṉavaṟṟuḷ |āṇpāl ``pōttu*''eṉa+ kūṟutaṟku* uriya |eṉṟavāṟu. (44)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_589">{SA TP589i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 45}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>mayilu meḻā|alum payilat tōṉṟum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) mayiluḷḷum |eḻāluḷḷum |aṇiṉaip ``pōttu*'' eṉṟalperumpāṉmai |eṉṟavāṟu. (45)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_590">{SA TP590i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 46}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|iralaiyuṅ kalaiyum pulvāyk kuriya.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) ``|iralai'' |eṉṉum peyarum ``kalai'' |eṉṉum peyarumpulvāyil |āṇpāṟku* uriya |eṉṟavāṟu. (46)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_591">{SA TP591i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 47}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>kalaiyeṉ kāṭci |uḻaikkum |urittē
<li>nilaiyiṟ ṟappeyar mucuviṉ kaṇṇum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) kalai |eṉṉum peyar |uḻaikku* -um mucuviṟku* -um|urittu* eṉṟavāṟu. (47)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_592">{SA TP592i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 48}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>mōttaiyun takarum |utaḷum |apparum
<li>yātta |eṉpa yāṭṭiṉ kaṇṇē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) ``mōttai'' mutalāka+ collappaṭṭaṉa yāṭṭil |āṇiṟku*uriya ~eṉṟavāṟu. (48)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_593">{SA TP593i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 49}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>cēvaṟ peyarkkoṭai ciṟakoṭu civaṇum
<li>māyirun tūvi mayilalaṅ kaṭaiyē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) mayil allāta puḷḷiṉkaṇ |āṇpeyar cēval eṉṟu kūṟappaṭumeṉṟavāṟu.

``ciṟaku'' |eṉṟatu |āku-peyar. (49)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_594">{SA TP594i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 50}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|āṟṟaloṭu puṇarnta |āṇpāṟ kellām
<li>|ēṟṟaik kiḷavi |uritteṉa moḻipa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |āṟṟal uṭaittu*-ākiya |āṇ-pāṟku* -ellām ``|ēṟṟai''~eṉṉum peyar |urittu* eṉṟavāṟu.

|ēṟpuḻikkōṭal |eṉpataṉāṉ |aḵṟiṇaikkaṇṇum koḷḷappaṭum. (50)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_595">{SA TP595i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 51}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|āṇpāl |ellām |āṇeṉaṟ kuriya
<li>peṇpāl |ellām peṇṇeṉaṟ kuriya
<li>kāṇpavai |avaiyavai |appā lāṉa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |āṇpāl-uyir -ellām |āṇ |eṉṉum peyar peṟum; peṇpāl-uyir-ellām peṇ |eṉṉum peyar peṟum; |avviru vakaikku* -um |aṟikuṟikāṇṭalāṉ |eṉṟavāṟu.

``vēḻakku* urittu*'' eṉṉum cūttiram* (35) mutalāka |ittuṇaiyum|āṇ peyar kūṟiṉār. |iṉip peṇpeyar kūṟukiṉṟār ākaliṉ|atikārappaṭṭa poruḷ cē, kaṭuvaṉ, kaṇṭi |eṉpaṉaciṟappu+-cūttirattu* ākaliṉ |ataṟkuriya ~eṉa+ kūṟiṟṟilar -āleṉiṉ. |avaṟṟuḷ kaṭuvaṉum kaṇṭiyum muṉṉar eṭuttōtappaṭum. cē|eṉpatu |āviṉuḷ |āṇaiyē kuṟittu vaḻaṅkaliṉ |otārāyiṉār. |īṇṭu|otappaṭṭaṉa pala poruḷ |oru collum |oru poruṭ pala collum |eṉṟukoḷka.

|ittuṇaiyuṅ kūṟappaṭṭatu: vēḻattuḷ |āṇ, kaḷiṟu, |oruttal, |eṟṟai|eṉappaṭum; paṉṟiyuḷ |āṇ, |oruttal |ēṟṟai |eṉappaṭum; pulvāyuḷ|āṇ, |oruttal, |ēṟu, |ēṟṟai, pōttu, |iralai, kalai |eṉappaṭum;puliyuḷ |āṇ, |oruttal, pōttu, |ēṟṟai, |eṉappaṭum; |uḻaiyuḷ |āṇ,|oruttal, |ēṟu, kalai, |ēṟṟai |eṉappaṭum; maraiyuḷ |āṇ, |oruttal,|ēṟu, pōttu, |ēṟṟai, |eṉappaṭum: kavariyuḷ |āṇ, |oruttal, |ēṟu,|ēṟṟai |eṉappaṭum; karāttuḷ |āṇ, |oruttal, |ēṟu, |ēṟṟai|eṉappaṭum; |erumaiyuḷ |āṇ, |oruttal, pōttu, |ēṟṟai kaṇṭi|eṉappaṭum; cuṟavil |āṇ |eṉpaṉa, |ēṟṟai |eṉappaṭum: peṟṟattuḷ|āṇ, pōttu, |ēṟu, |ēṟṟai |eṉappaṭum; `|erutu kāluṟātu* iḷaiyarkoṉṟa' |eṉa varutaliṉ |erutum |ām; |atikāra+-puṟaṉaṭaiyāṟ koḷka.nīrvāḻ cātiyuḷ |āṇ, varāṟ pōttu vāḷaippōttu |eṉa varum. mucuvil|āṇ, kalai |eṉappaṭum; kuraṅkum, |ūkamum |ivvāṟē koḷḷappaṭum;kaṭuvaṉ |eṉavum varum. |āṭṭiṉuḷ |āṇ, mōttai, takar, |utaḷ, |appar|eṉa varum: puḷḷiṉuḷ mayilāṇ, |eḻāl, cēval, pōttu, |ēṟṟai|eṉappaṭum; puḷḷiṉuḷ |āṇ -ellāvaṟṟilum mayil -allātaṉa -~ellāmcēval |ēṟṟai |eṉappaṭum. |oraṟivuyiruḷ |āṇ peṇ vēṟupaṭuttal āvaṉa|ēṟṟaippaṉai |āṇpaṉai |eṉavarum. (51)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_596">{SA TP596i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 52}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>piṭiyeṉ peṇpeyar yāṉai mēṟṟē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|iṉip peṇpeyar |uṇarttukiṉṟār |iccūttira mutalāka.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) piṭi |eṉṉum peṇpeyar |āṉaiyiṉ mēlatu |eṉṟavāṟu. (52)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_597">{SA TP597i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 53}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|oṭṭakam kutirai kaḻutai maraiyivai
<li>peṭṭai yeṉṉum peyarkkoṭaik kuriya.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) peṭṭai |eṉṉum peyar |oṭṭaka mutalākac collappaṭṭanāṉkukkum peṇpāṟkup peyarām |eṉṟavāṟu. (53)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_598">{SA TP598i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 54}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>puḷḷum |uriya |appeyark keṉpa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) peṭṭai |eṉṉum peyarukku+ puḷḷiṟ peṇ-pāl -um uriya|eṉṟavāṟu. (54)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_599">{SA TP599i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 55}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
