<li>cevvāyk kiḷḷaiyait tattai |eṉṟalum
<li>vevvāy verukiṉaip pūcai |eṉṟalum
<li>kutiraiyuḷ |āṇiṉaic cēval |eṉṟalum
<li>|iruḷniṟap paṉṟiyai |ēṉam |eṉṟalum
