<P>|itaṉāṉē puṟa-vayirppu* -um |uḷ-vayirppu* -um |illātaṉavaṟṟuḷ|oru cāraṇa |ivvuṟuppuppeyar |uṭaiyaṉa maram eṉappaṭum eṉṟukoḷka.

<P>|avaiyāvaṉa: murukku taṇakku mutalāyiṉa. (89)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_634">{SA TP634i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 90}
