<li>vīḻō ṭeṉṟāṅ kavaiyum |aṉṉa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) |iccūttiram |avviruvakaikkum piṟkūṟaliṟ kāy mutalākaccollappaṭṭa |avvuṟuppuppeyar |avviruvakaikkum potu ~eṉappaṭumeṉṟavāṟu.

tāḻai pū-~uṭaittu* ākalāṉum kōṭu* uṭaittu* ākalāṉum puṟavayirppu*iṉmaiyāṉum maram eṉappaṭum āyiṉum pul |eṉṟal perumpāṉmai. (90)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_635">{SA TP635i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 91}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>nilamtī nīrvaḷi vicumpo ṭaintuṅ
<li>kalanta mayakkam |ulakam |ātaliṉ
<li>|irutiṇai |aimpāl |iyaṉeṟi vaḻāmait
<li>tirivil colloṭu taḻā|al vēṇṭum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. |itu -~um -ōr marapu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |ulaku nila mutalākiya |aimperumpūtaṅ kalanta mayakkamātalāṉ mēṟcollappaṭṭa poruḷkaḷait tiṇaiyum pālum vaḻāmaltiripu-paṭāta collōṭē taḻuvutal vēṇṭum |eṉṟavāṟu.
kalattal āvatu muttum pavaḷamum nīlamum māṇikkamum viraviṉāṟpōṟal.

mayakkam -āvatu poṉ= -um veḷḷi -~um cempu* um |urukki ~oṉṟu*-ātalpōṟal.

|ulakam eṉṟatu |ulakiṉai -~um |ulakiṉuṭ poruḷai -~um. |ulakam-āvatu muttu* -um maṇi -~um^ kalantāṟpōla nilam nīr tī vaḷi|ākāyam |eṉa viravi-niṟkum. |ulakiṉuṭ poruḷ poṉṉum veḷḷiyumcempum |urukki ~oṉṟu*-āṉāṟpōla vēṟṟumai+-paṭātu -niṟkum; |av=iraṇṭiṉai ~-um |ulaku* -um |uṭaittu*-ākaliṟ kalanta mayakkameṉṟār.

|ipporuḷ |ellā- ~ulakattai -~um viṭṭu-nīṅkāmaiyiṉ |ivaṟṟai|oru-mukattāṉ nōkka vēṟupāṭu* ila-~ām ātalāṉ mēṟ kūṟi+-pōntamuṟaiyiṉāṉ vēṟupaṭuttu |irutiṇai -~ākavum {?{|aimpālāvum}?}|iyaṉṟa-neṟi vaḻuvāmai+ {?{tirapupaṭāta}?} collōṭē puṇarkka|eṉṟavāṟu* ām.

|utāraṇam
{cāttaṉ cōṟṟai |uṇṭāṉ} |eṉpatu. |itu {?{|uṇṭat kuriyāṉ}?} eṉa+kūṟutaliṉ marapu* āyiṟṟu. |aḵtēl vaḻāmai taḻālvēṇṭum eṉa+karutiyaporuḷ muṭiyum; ``tirivilcol'' |eṉṟatu mikai ~eṉiṉ,|okkum. kuḻavi |eṉpatu |uyartiṇaikkaṇ variṉ |ataṟkuriya pālāṟkūṟātu |aḵṟiṇaikkuriya pālāṟ kūṟappaṭutaliṉ |avvakaiyāṉ varuvaṉavaḻuvāyiṉum ``tirivilcol'' |eṉṟataṉāṉ |ituvum |aṭakkik kūṟiṉār.(91)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_636">{SA TP636i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 92}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>marapunilai tirital ceyyuṭ killai
<li>marapu vaḻippaṭṭa colli ṉāṉa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. ceyyuṭku* uriyatu* -ōr marapu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |īṇṭuc collappaṭṭa ``marapu-nilaiyiṟ ^tirital''ceyyuṭku* illai; marapu vaḻippaṭṭa colliṉāṟ ceyya vēṇṭutaliṉ|eṉṟavāṟu.

|eṉavē yātāṉum |oru ceyyuḷ -um |īṇṭu* ōtiya marapiṉāṟ ceyyavēṇṭum |eṉṟavāṟām.

ceyyuṭku* illai |eṉavē vaḻakkiṉuṭ cila tiriya -~um -peṟum. |avaicūtu*-urai -~uḷ |āṇiṉai+ pōttu* eṉṟal pōlvaṉa. (92)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_637">{SA TP637i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 93}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>marapunilai tiriyiṟ piṟitu piṟitākum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) marapu nilai-tirintu -variṟ poruḷ vēṟu-vēṟu* ākumeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|eṉavē vaḻu ~eṉṟavāṟu* -ām. (93)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_638">{SA TP638i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 94}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>vaḻakkeṉap paṭuva tuyarntōr mēṟṟē
<li>nikaḻcci |avarkaṭ ṭāka lāṉa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ |aiyam-aṟuttalai nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) vaḻakku* eṉṟu collappaṭṭatu |uyarntōr mēlatu; nūliṉnikaḻcci |avar-māṭṭu* ātalāṉ |eṉṟavāṟu.

``marapu nilai-tirital'' ceyyuṭku* illai ~eṉa -~um |ataṉāṉēvaḻakkiṟ ciṟupāṉmai varum eṉa -~um ceyyuḷ marapu |oḻiya-variṉ|atu vaḻu -~ām eṉa -~um kūṟiṉār āyiṟ pāyirattuḷ ``vaḻakkuñceyyuḷum āyiru mutaliṉ eḻuttuñ collum poruḷu nāṭi'' |eṉṟataṉōṭumāṟukoḷḷum -ō ~-eṉa |aiyuṟṟārkku |āṇṭu vaḻakku* eṉṟucollappaṭṭatu |uyarntōr-vaḻakkiṉai |eṉa -~um |iḻintōr-vaḻakkuvaḻakku* eṉappaṭātu* eṉavum kūṟiyavāṟu. (94)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_639">{SA TP639i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 95}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>marapunilai tiriyā māṭciya vāki
<li>|uraipaṭu nūltām |iruvakai nilaiya
<li>mutalum vaḻiyumeṉa nutaliya neṟiyiṉa.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. mēṟ ceyyuḷ-iyal -uḷ tōṟṟuvāy ceyta nūlai|ilakkaṇa-vakaiyāṉ |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) marapu* -āvatu nūṟku |iṉṟiyamaiyāta |iyalpu. |av=iyalpu tiriyāta marapu* uṭaittu* -āki |uraikka+-paṭum nūl -tām|iru-vakaiya; mutal*^nūl |eṉa -~um vaḻi-nūl |eṉavum |eṉṟavāṟu.
|uraikka ~eṉpatu vikārattāl tokkatu.

|atu varukiṉṟa cūttirattāṟ kūṟupa.

cārpu-nūl |eṉpatu* -um |oṉṟu* uṇṭu* -āl eṉiṉ, |aḵtu |iruvar|āciriyar kūṟiyavataṟku |uṭampaṭṭu varutaliṉ |atu -~um vaḻi-nūleṉa |aṭaṅkum: |etir-nūl |eṉpatu* -um |oṉṟu* uṇṭu |atu -~um |orumuṉaivaṉāṟ ceyya+-paṭiṉ mutal*^nūl ām; piṟar ceyyiṉ vaḻaṅkātu.(95)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_640">{SA TP640i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 96}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>viṉaiyiṉ nīṅki viḷaṅkiya |aṟiviṉ
<li>muṉaivaṉ kaṇṭatu mutaṉū lākum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. niṟuttamuṟaiyāṉē mutaṉūl āmāṟu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
cūttirattāṟ poruḷ viḷaṅkum. (96)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_641">{SA TP641i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 97}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>vaḻiyeṉap paṭuva tataṉvaḻit tākum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. vaḻinūl āmāṟu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) vaḻinūl |eṉappaṭuvatu mutalvaṉ kaṇṭa nūl -vaḻi -~ēceyvatu |eṉṟavāṟu.

|aḵtēl, |itaṉāṟ payaṉ |eṉṉai ~eṉiṉ, |atu varukiṉṟa cūttirattāṉviḷaṅkum. (97)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_642">{SA TP642i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 98}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>vaḻiyiṉ neṟiyē nālvakait tākum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ-|eṉiṉ. vaḻi-nūl pāku-paṭum -āṟu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) vaḻi-nūl |eṉa+-paṭuvatu {{nāṉku-vakai+ -paṭum}}|eṉṟavāṟu.

|atu muṉṉar+ kūṟutum. (98)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_643">{SA TP643i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 99}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>tokuttal virittal tokaiviri moḻipeyart
<li>tatarppaṭa yāttalō ṭaṉaimara piṉavē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ vaḻi-nūl vakai ~ām-āṟu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) mutaṉūl-āciriyaṉ virittu+ {?{ceytatalai+}?}tokuttu+-ceytal -um, tokuttu+-ceytatiṉai virittu+-ceytal -um,|av= iru-vakaiyiṉai -~um tokai-viri -~āka+ collutal -um,vaṭamoḻi+-paṉuvalai moḻi-peyarttu+ tamiḻ-moḻiyāṟ ceytal -um|eṉṟavāṟu.

|itu vaḻi-nūlāṉ āya payaṉ. (99)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_644">{SA TP644i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 100}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|otta cūttiram |uraippiṟ kāṇṭikai
<li>meyppaṭak kiḷanta vakaiya tāki
<li>|īraiṅ kuṟṟamum |iṉṟi nēritiṉ
<li>muppat tiruvakai |uttiyoṭu puṇariṉ
<li>nūleṉa moḻipa nuṇaṅkumoḻip pulavar.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ. nūṟku |ilakkaṇam |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |iṉi, |otta cūttirattāṉum kāṇṭikaiyāṉum poruṇmēṟkūṟiya vakaiyuṭaittāki+ {{pattu+-kuṟṟam -um}} |iṉṟi nuṇṇitu*ākiya muppattu*-iraṇṭu {?{vakaippaṭ}?} tantira-~uttiyōṭu puṇarum-āyiṉ nūl eṉa+ colluvar pulavar |eṉṟavāṟu.

|uraippiṉ |eṉpataṉai muṉṉē kūṭṭi nūl uraippiṉ |eṉap poruḷuraikka. |avai ~ām-āṟu muṉṉar+ kāṭṭutum. (100)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_645">{SA TP645i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 101}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|uraiyeṭut tataṉmuṉ yāppiṉuñ cūttiram
<li>puraitapa |uṭaṉpaṭak kāṇṭikai pūṇarppiṉum
<li>vitittalum vilakkalum |eṉaviru vakaiyoṭu
<li>puṇarntavai nāṭip puṇarkkavum peṟumē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|ituvumatu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) cūttirattiṉ muṉṉar |uraiyai virittu* uraikkum -iṭattu*-um cūttira+-poruḷ viḷaṅka+ kāṇṭikai puṇarkkum -iṭattum |āciriyaṉ|i+ poruḷ |ivvāṟu kūṟal vēṇṭum eṉa vitittal -um |ipporuḷ |ivvāṟukūṟa+-poṟāṉ eṉa vilakkal -um ākiya |iru-vakaiyōṭu* -ē kūṭa+poruntiṉavavai |ārāyntu puṇarkka -~um |ām |eṉṟavāṟu.

|itaṉāṟ colliyatu |āciriyaṉ coṉṉa cūttirattiṉai+ kuṟai-paṭa+kūṟiṉāṉ eṉṟal |amaiyāmaiyāṉum |avaṉ kūṟukiṉṟa poruḷiṉainilai-peṟuttaṟku+ piṟitoṉṟai virittotiya neṟiyai vilakkiyum poruḷ|uraittu+ koḷḷappaṭum eṉṟavāṟu.

ceyyuḷiyaluḷ, 
``nūleṉap paṭuvatu nuvaluṅ kālai
  mutalum muṭivum māṟukō ḷiṉṟit
  tokaiyiṉum vakaiyiṉum poruṇmai kāṭṭi
  |uṇṇiṉ ṟakaṉṟa |uraiyoṭu porunti
  nuṇṇitiṉ viḷakkal |atuvataṉ paṇpē,''
    (ceyyuḷiyal. 159)
|eṉṟu kūṟutaliṉ |itu -~um |ilakkaṇam āka+ koḷka. (101)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_646">{SA TP646i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 102}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>mēṟkiḷan teṭutta yāppiṉuṭ poruḷoṭu
<li>cilvakai |eḻuttiṉ ceyyuṭṭākic
<li>colluṅ kālai |uraiyakat taṭakki
<li>nuṇmaiyoṭu puṇarnta |oṇmait tākit
<li>tuḷakkal |ākāt tuṇaimai yeyti
<li>|aḷakkal |ākā |arumporuṭ ṭākip
<li>palvakai yāṉum payaṉteri puṭaiyatu
<li>cūttirat tiyalpeṉa yāttaṉar pulavar.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ nūṟku |aṅkam ākiya cūttirattu*-ilakkaṇam |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēl tokuttal virittal tokaiviri moḻipeyarttu |atarppaṭayāttal |eṉa nālvakaiyiṉum collappaṭṭa poruḷōṭu, cilaveḻuttiṉāṉ|iyaṉṟa ceyyuṭṭāki, |uraikkuṅkālattu |avvuraiyiṟ poruḷ -ellāmtaṉ=-akattu* aṭakki, nuṇṇiya poruṇmaiyoṭu poruntiya viḷakkamuṭaittu*-āki, keṭukkal -ākāta tuṇai+-cūttiraṅkaḷai ~uṭaittu*-ākivaraiyaṟukka+-paṭāta |ariya-poruḷai ~uṭaittu*-āki+ palavāṟṟāṉumpayaṉai ~ārāytal |uṭaiyatu cūttiram |eṉa+ kūṟiṉār pulavar|eṉṟavāṟu.

|aḷakkal -ākā |arum poruḷ -āvatu pala-mukattāṉum poruḷ-koḷḷa+-kiṭattal.

ceyyuḷiyaluḷ,
``cūttiran tāṉē
  |āṭi nīḻaliṉ |aṟiyat tōṉṟi
  nāṭuta liṉṟip poruḷ naṉi viḷaṅki
  yāppiṉuḷ tōṉṟa yāttamaip patuvē.
    (ceyyuḷiyal. 162)
|eṉpatū|um |itaṟku* ilakkaṇam. (102)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_647">{SA TP647i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 103}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>paḻippil cūttiram paṭṭa paṇpiṟ
<li>karappiṉṟi muṭivatu kāṇṭikai yākum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|eṉ--|eṉiṉ: kāṇṭikai ~ām-āṟu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) kuṟṟam-illāta cūttiram~ coṉṉa |iyalpiṉāṉ maṟaivu* iṉṟiviḷakkuvatu kāṇṭikai ~ām eṉṟavāṟu. (103)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_648">{SA TP648i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 104}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>viṭṭakal viṉṟi virivoṭu poruntic
<li>cuṭṭiya cūttira muṭittaṟ poruṭṭā
<li>|ētu naṭaiyiṉum |eṭuttuk kāṭṭiṉum
<li>mēvāṅ kamainta meynneṟit tatuvē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|itu -~um atu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) cūttirattiṟ paṭuñ coṟ poruḷai viṭṭu nīṅkutal iṉṟivirivōṭu* -ē porunti+ kuṟitta cūttira muṭittaṟku* -āka|ētu-neṟiyāṉum |eṭuttu+-kāṭṭiṉāṉum poruntiyāṅku* amaiyumporuṇeṟiyai ~uṭaittuk kāṇṭikai ~eṉṟavāṟu.

``viṭṭakalviṉṟi'' virivoṭu poruntal -āvatu mika |akalāmai. {|immaṉai neruppu* uṭaittu*} eṉṟatu cūttira+-poruḷ; {pukai ~uṭaittu*ātalāṉ} eṉpatu |ētu; {|aṭukkaḷai pōla} ~eṉpatu |eṭuttu+-kāṭṭu.|ivvakaiyiṉāṟ cūttira+-poruḷ uraikka ~eṉṟavāṟu. (104)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_649">{SA TP649i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 105}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>cūttirat tuṭ poru ḷaṉṟiyum yāppuṟa
<li>|iṉṟi yamaiyā tiyaipavai |ellām
<li>|oṉṟa |uraippa turaiyeṉap paṭumē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|urai ~āmāṟu |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) cūttirattuṭ poruḷ oḻiyavum |annūl akattil yāppiṟku*-um porunta |iṉṟiyamaiyātaṉa ~ellām^ koṇarntu porunta |uraippatu|urai ~ākum eṉṟavāṟu. (105)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_650">{SA TP650i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 106}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>maṟutalaik kaṭā |a māṟṟamu muṭaittāyt
<li>taṉṉū lāṉum muṭintanū lāṉum
<li>|aiyamu maruṭkaiyuñ cevvitiṉ nīkkit
<li>teṟṟeṉa |oruporuḷ |oṟṟumai koḷī |it
<li>tuṇivoṭu niṟṟal |eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|ituvumatu.

<P>(|i-ḷ) |urai -~āvatu, ``maṟutalaikkaṭā |a māṟṟamumuṭaittāka'', |aiya+-paṭṭu -niṟṟal -um* maruṇṭu -niṟṟal -um*nīkki, taṉṉūlāṉ ātal |apporuṇ muṭivu*-uṟa+ kūṟiṉa nūlāṉ ātalteḷiya ~oru poruḷai ~oṟṟumai+-paṭuttu, |itu -~ē poruḷ eṉa+tuṇital |uraiyiṟku* iyalpu* eṉṟavāṟu.

māṟṟam uṭaittu*-āki ~eṉṟa ~ummaiyāl viṭai -~um uṭaittu*-āki~eṉka. (106)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_651">{SA TP651i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 107}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>collap paṭṭaṉa |ellā māṇpum
<li>maṟutalai yāyiṉ maṟṟatu citaivē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
<P>(|i-ḷ.) mēlavaṟṟiṟku* {?{ōtalāṉa}*} nūṟku* uriyatu* -ōr marapumutaṉūl āyiṟ citaivu* illai ~eṉṟavāṟu. |eṉṉai |āvaṉa kūṟiyatu{?{viriyakalātaṉa}?} citaivatu vaḻi-nūl eṉṟavāṟām. (107)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_652">{SA TP652i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 108}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>citaivila |eṉpa mutalvaṉ kaṇṇē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
(108)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_653">{SA TP653i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 109}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>mutalvaḻi yāyiṉum yāppiṉuṭ citaiyum
<li>vallōṉ puṉaiyā vāram pōṉṟē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
vaḻinūṟku* uriyatu* -ōr marapu* uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) mutaṉūliṉ vaḻicceyyiṉum |annūl yāppiṉuṭ citaiyumvallavaṉ puṉaiyāta vārampōla veṉṟavāṟu.

{?{kōvaivāciyā (?) ṉeṉṟavāṟām.}?} (109)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_654">{SA TP654i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 110}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>citaiveṉap paṭupavai vacaiyaṟa nāṭiṟ
<li>kūṟiyatu kūṟal māṟukoḷak kūṟal
<li>kuṉṟak kūṟal mikaipaṭak kūṟal
<li>poruḷila kūṟal mayaṅkak kūṟal
<li>kēṭpōrk kiṉṉā yāppiṟ ṟātal
<li>paḻitta moḻiyāṉ |iḻukkak kūṟal
<li>taṉṉāṉ |oruporuḷ karutik kūṟal
<li>|eṉṉa vakaiyiṉum maṉaṅkōḷ |iṉmai
<li>|aṉṉa piṟavum |avaṟṟuviri yākum.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
mēl atikāra+-paṭṭa |īr-aim^ kuṟṟam -um |āmāṟu |uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) ``kūṟiyatu kūṟal'' -āvatu |oru-kāṟ kūṟiyataṉai+ piṉ=-um^ kūṟal.

``māṟu-koḷak kūṟal'' -āvatu |oru-kāṟ kūṟiya poruḷōṭu māṟu-koḷḷum-āṟu piṉ-kūṟal. |aḵtāvatu tavam naṉṟu {?{|eṉṟavaṉṟāṉ}?} tavantītu* eṉṟu kūṟal.

``kuṉṟa+ kūṟal'' -āvatu tāṉ atikaritta poruḷkaḷ -uṭ cilavaṟṟai+kūṟātu* -oḻital.

``mikai-paṭa+ kūṟal'' -āvatu |atikāra+-poruḷ aṉṟi+ piṟa poruḷ-um^ kūṟutal. |aḵtāvatu tamiḻ-ilakkaṇañ colluvāṉ-eṭuttukkoṇṭāṉvaṭamoḻi-~ilakkaṇam -um kūṟal.

``poruḷ-ila kūṟal'' -āvatu muṉṉum piṉṉum varukiṉṟa poruṇmaikku*oppu*-iṉṟi+ payaṉ-illātaṉa kūṟal.

``mayaṅka+ kūṟal'' -āvatu kēṭṭārkku+ poruḷ viḷaṅkum-āṟu* iṉṟi+kūṟal.

``kēṭpōrkku* iṉṉā yāppiṟṟu* -ātal'' eṉpatu poruḷ yākkappaṭṭacūttiram^ cantaviṉpam iṉṟi-~iruttal.

``paḻitta moḻiyāṉ |iḻukka+ kūṟal'' -āvatu tāṉ oru poruḷai ~oruvāypāṭṭāṟ ^tirittu+ piṟatu* oru vāypāṭṭāṟ kūṟutal. |a+ kuṟippu|ulaka-vaḻakku* iṉmaiyāṟ piṟarkku+ pula+-paṭātu* -ām; |ataṉāl|atuvum^ kuṟṟam -āyiṟṟu.

``|eṉṉa vakaiyiṉum maṉaṅkōḷ |iṉmai -~āvatu |eḻuttiṉāṉuñcolliṉāṉum poruḷiṉāṉum maṉam^-koḷḷumāṟu kūṟāmai. (110)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_655">{SA TP655i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 111}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|etirmaṟut tuṇariṉat tiṟattavum |avaiyē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
|ituvumatu. nūṟ-kuṟṟam |uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.) |etirmaṟuttu |uṇarvar -āyiṉ, |attiṟattavum kuṟṟam -āmeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>|utāraṇam
{pāvam^ ceytāṉ niraiyam pukum} eṉa+ karuti+ kūṟuvāṉ {tavañ ceyvāṉcuvaṟkam pukum} eṉṟal. |ivvā kūṟic cuvaṟkam peṟu meṉṉumporuṭ..... niraiyam pukum eṉṟa poruḷ tōṉṟāmaiyiṟ kuṟṟam -āyiṟṟu.(111)

<HR>
<H3><A NAME="_TPi_656">{SA TP656i}</A></H3>
<BR>{Z 112}
<P>{C TOL}
<ol>
<li>|otta kāṭci |uttivakai virippiṉ
<li>nutaliya taṟital |atikāra muṟaiyē
<li>tokuttuk kūṟal vakuttumeyn niṟuttal
<li>moḻinta poruḷō ṭoṉṟa vaittal
<li>moḻiyā tataṉai muṭṭiṉṟi muṭittal
<li>vārā tataṉāṉ vantatu muṭittal
<li>vantatu koṇṭu vārātatu muṭittal
<li>muntu moḻintataṉ talaitaṭu māṟṟē
<li>|oppak kūṟal |orutalai moḻiyē
<li>taṉkōṭ kūṟal |uṭampoṭu puṇarttal
<li>piṟaṉuṭam paṭṭatu tāṉuṭam paṭutal
<li>|iṟantatu kāttal |etiratu pōṟṟal
<li>moḻivām |eṉṟal kūṟiṟ ṟeṉṟal
<li>tāṉkuṟi yiṭutal |orutalai yaṉmai
<li>muṭintatu kāṭṭal |āṇai kūṟal
<li>palporuṭ kēṟpiṉ nallatu kōṭal
<li>tokutta moḻiyāṉ vakuttaṉar kōṭal
<li>maṟutalai citaittut taṉtuṇi puraittal
<li>piṟaṉkōṭ kūṟal |aṟiyā tuṭampaṭal
<li>poruḷiṭaiya yiṭutal |etirporuḷ |uṇarttal
<li>colliṉ |eccam colliyāṅ kuṇarttal
<li>tantupuṇarn turaittal ñāpakam kūṟal
<li>|uyttukkoṇ ṭuṇarttaloṭu meyppaṭa nāṭic
<li>colliya |alla piṟavavaṇ variṉum
<li>colliya vakaiyāṟ curuṅka nāṭi
<li>maṉatti ṉeṇṇi mācaṟat terintukoṇṭu
<li>|iṉattiṟ cērtti |uṇarttal vēṇṭum
<li>nuṉittaku pulavar kūriya nūlē.
</ol>

<P>{C URAI}
tantira-~utti ~ām-āṟu* uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>|itaṉ poḻippu: ``nutaliyatu* aṟital'' mutalāka+ collappaṭṭaṉa-~um |attaṉmaiya piṟavun tantira |utti -~ām |eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>tantiram eṉiṉum nūl eṉiṉum |okkum. |utti ~eṉpatu vaṭa-moḻi+citaivu. |atu cūttirattiṉ-pāṟ kiṭappatu* ōr poruḷ-vēṟupāṭukāṭṭuvatu.

<P>(|i-ḷ.)
((1)) ``|ottakāṭci |uttivakai virippiṉ'' eṉpatu nūṟku+ poruntiyakāṭciyiṉāṉ uraikkum |utti-vakaiyai virikkum^ -kālattu* eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>((2)) ``nutaliyatu* aṟital'' -āvatu -- cūttirattiṟ {?{coṟṟa}?}poruḷ uṇarttalaṉṟi; |itaṉ karuttu* itu ~eṉa |uṇarttal.

<P>|aḵtāvatu ``|eḻutteṉappaṭupa'' (nūṉmarapu:ka) |eṉṉuñcūttirattuḷ `|eḻuttu |iṉaittu* eṉa varaiyaṟuttu*-uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu' |eṉṟal.

<P>((3)) ``|atikāra muṟai'' -~āvatu -- muṉṉam palaporuḷai~atikaritta -vaḻi+ piṉṉum |a= muṟaiyiṉāṉē virittu*-uṇarttutal.

<P>|aḵtāvatu |uyartiṇai ~aḵṟiṇai ~eṉa |atikarittu ``|āṭū|u vaṟicol'' (kiḷaviyākkam-2) |eṉṉuñ cūttirattāṉ niṟutta-muṟai piṟaḻāmal|uyartiṇai kūṟal. |iṉṉum |itaṉāṉē |oru cūttirattilē karutiṉaporuḷai vaittu varukiṉṟa cūttirattuḷ |otātu |ataṉ kāriyam -āyiṉakūṟiya -vaḻi |ataṉai+ cūttiram^ tōṟuṅ koṇarnturaittal. |aḵtāvatu``|akara~-iṟuti+ peyar-nilai muṉṉar'' (|uyirmayaṅkiyal-1) |eṉṉum^cūttirattiṟ ``kacatapa+ tōṉṟiṉ'' eṉa ~ōti ``viṉai-~eñcu kiḷavi-~um'' (|uyir mayaṅkiyal-2) eṉṉum^ cūttirattuḷ |otiṟṟu*-ilarāyiṉum |atikāra-muṟaimaiyiṉāṉ val=-eḻuttu varuvaḻi ~eṉa~uraittal.

<P>((4)) ``tokuttu+ kūṟal'' -āvatu -- vakaipeṟa+ kūṟal vēṇṭumāyiṉum |ataṉai+ tokuttu+ kūṟal.

<P>((5)) ``|eḻuttatu* eṉa+-paṭupa |akara-mutal* ṉakara-~iṟuvāymuppaḵtu* eṉpa'' ((nūṉmarapu. 1)) |eṉṟāṟpōlvaṉa. |iṉṉum palacūttirattāṟ kūṟiya poruḷai |ittuṇaiyum^ kūṟappaṭṭatu* itu ~eṉa+kūṟal -um ām.

<P>((6)) ``tūkkiyal vakaiyē yāṅkeṉa moḻipa''. (ceyyuḷiyal-83)|eṉpataṉāṟkoḷka.

<P>((7)) ``vakuttu mey+ niṟuttal'' -āvatu -- tokai-paṭa+ kūṟiyaporuḷai vakai-paṭa+ kūṟal.

<P>|atu `|a, |i, |u, |e, |o' (nūṉmarapu-3) |eṉṉuñ cūttirattāṟkoḷka. |iṉṉum ataṉāṉē tokai-paṭa+ cūttiram^ ceyta-vaḻi |avaṟṟuḷ|orōvoṉṟu potu-~ilakkaṇattāṉ muṭiyāta -vaḻi+ perumpāṉmaiciṟupāṉmai koṇṭu vakuttu+ poruḷ uraittal -um ām. |iṉṉum ataṉāṉētokai-paṭa+ kūṟiyavataṉai vakuttu+ poruḷ-uraittal -um -ām.

<P>((8)) ``moḻinta poruḷōṭu* oṉṟa vaittal'' -āvatu -- cūttirattuṭporuḷ pala-paṭa+ tōṉṟum -āyiṉ muṟpaṭṭa cūttirattiṟku* okkum poruḷuraittal.

<P>|aṉṟi -~um muṟpaṭṭa cūttirattiṉāṉ |oru poruḷ ōtiya -vaḻi+piṟpaṭṭa cūttiram -um poruḷōṭu* oṉṟa vaittal -um -ām.

<P>((9)) ``moḻiyātataṉai muṭṭiṉṟi muṭittal'' -āvatu--|eṭuttu*-ōtāta poruḷai muṭṭu+-paṭāmal |uraiyiṉāṉ muṭittal.

<P>|itaṉai `|uraiyiṟkōṭal' |eṉpa. |ikkaruttiṉāṉē,
cūttirattu* uṭporuḷ iṉṟiyum yāppuṟa
|iṉṟiyamaiyātu* iyaipavai ~ellām
|oṉṟa ~uraippatu* urai ~eṉa+-paṭum -ē. (marapiyal- 115)
|eṉa |ōtuvār -āyiṟṟu* eṉka.

<P>((10)) ``vārātataṉāṉ vantatu muṭittal'' -āvatu -- |oruṅku*eṇṇappaṭṭa poruḷ oṉṟaṉai+ pakuttu+ kūṟiya -vaḻi |āṇṭuvārātataṟku* ōtiya ~ilakkaṇattai |itaṉkaṇ= -um varuvittu*uṇarttutal.

<P>((11)) ``vantatu koṇṭu vārātatu muṭittal'' -āvatu -- |oruṅku*{?{oṇṇap paṭṭavaṟṟuḷ}?} oṉṟai+ pakuttu |ilakkaṇam^ kūṟiya -vaḻivārātataṉkaṇ= um |iv= ilakkaṇattai+ kūṭṭi muṭittal.

<P>((12)) ``muntu moḻintataṉ talaitaṭumāṟṟu*'' -āvatu -- muṟpaṭa|atikaritta poruḷai ~avvakaiyiṉāṟ kūṟātu muṟai piṟaḻa+ kūṟutal.

<P>|ivvāṟu kūṟum^ -kāl |oru-payaṉ*^nōkki+ kūṟal vēṇṭum. |atupuḷḷi-mayaṅkiyal -uṭ kaṇṭu-koḷka.

<P>((13)) ``|oppa+-kūṟal'' eṉpatu -- |oru poruḷ eṭuttu|ilakkaṇam^ kūṟiya -vaḻi |atu pōlvaṉavaṟṟai -~um ilakkaṇattāṉmuṭittal.

<P>((14)) ``|oru-talai moḻi'' -~āvatu -- {?{|ēkākkaram}?} eṉṉumvaṭa-moḻi+ poruṇmai. |aḵtāvatu, cūttirattiṟku+ poruḷ kavarttu+tōṉṟiṉ {?{|ataṉu}?} ḷoṉṟiṉait tuṇintu kūṟal.

<P>((15)) ``taṉ-kōṭ kūṟal'' -āvatu -- piṟa-nūl āciriyarkūṟiyavāṟu kūṟātu taṉ kōṭpāṭṭāl kūṟutal.

<P>|atu vēṟṟumai |eṭṭeṉṟal.

<P>((16)) ``|uṭampoṭu puṇarttal'' -āvatu -- |ilakkaṇa-vakaiyāṉ{?{|otutal}?} -aṉṟi ~āciriyaṉukku* iṉṟi+ cūttirattiṉkaṇ= -ē ~orucollai vaippaṉ āyiṉ {?{|avvaippiṉai}?} |ilakkaṇam -āka+ kōṭal.

<P>|oṟṟu*-īṟṟu+-collai ~ukaram^ koṭuttu+ kūṟuka ~eṉa ~ilakkaṇam^kūṟiṟṟu* ilar āyiṉum, ``|ārum |aruvum |īroṭu civaṇum'' viḷimarapu(21) |eṉa |otutaliṉ, `|ār' |eṉpatu `|ārum' |eṉa |ukaram peṟṟatu.|itaṉai+ piṟāṇṭum^ kōṭal.

<P>((17)) ``piṟaṉ uṭam-paṭṭatu tāṉ uṭam-paṭutal'' -āvatu --piṟa-nūl-āciriyaṉ |uṭam-paṭṭa poruṭku+ tāṉ uṭam-paṭutal.

<P>|aḵtāvatu |iraṇṭām vēṟṟumai ceyappaṭu-poruṭkaṇ varum eṉa+pāṇiṉiyār |otiṉār; |atu |ivarkku* -um |uṭampāṭu.

<P>((18)) ``|iṟantatu kāttal'' -āvatu -- mēṟ kūṟappaṭṭacūttirattāṟ kūṟappaṭāta poruḷai+ piṉ varukiṉṟa cūttirattāṉamaittal.

<P>((19)) ``|etiratu pōṟṟal'' -āvatu -- muṉ kūṟappaṭṭacūttirattāṉē varukiṉṟa cūttirattiṟ poruḷiṉai -~um pātukākkum -āṟuvaittal.

<P>((20)) ``moḻivām eṉṟal'' -āvatu -- cila poruḷai+ kūṟi |avaṟṟuḷoṉṟaṉai ~iṉṉaviṭattu+ kūṟuvām eṉa ~uraittal.

<P>``puṇar-iyal*-^nilai -~iṭai+ kuṟukal -um' ((moḻimarapu.2.))|eṉpataṉāṟ koḷka.

<P>((21)) ``kūṟiṟṟu* eṉṟal'' -āvatu -- pala poruḷ -āyatikarittavaṟṟuḷ+ cila poruḷai mēṟcollappaṭṭaṉa ~eṉṟal.

<P>``māttirai vakai -~um |eḻuttu*-iyal vakai ~-um*mēṟkiḷantaṉṉa'' ((ceyyuḷiyal.1)) |eṉṟataṉāṟ koḷka.

<P>((22)) ``tāṉ kuṟi-~iṭutal'' -āvatu -- |ulakiṉkaṇ vaḻakku* iṉṟi~oruporuṭku |āciriyaṉ ^tāṉ kuṟi-~iṭal.

<P>|aḵtu |uyartiṇai ~aḵṟiṇai ~eṉpaṉa.

<P>((23)) ``|oru-talai ~aṉmai muṭintatu kāṭṭal'' -āvatu -- |oruporuḷai ~ōtiya -vaḻi+ colluvataṟku* -ē ~urittu* aṉṟi+piṟa-poruṭku* -um potu -~āka muṭittamai kāṭṭal.

<P>((24)) ``|āṇai kūṟal'' -āvatu -- |oru poruḷai+ kūṟum -vaḻi|ētuviṉāṟ kūṟal aṉṟi+ taṉ= āṇaiyāṟ kūṟal.

<P>vēṟṟumai ~ēḻu* eṉa+ pāṇiṉiyār kūṟiṉamaiyiṉ |avar viḷiyaimutal-vēṟṟumaiyil aṭakkiṉār. |ataṟku+ tiripu kūṟātu |ataṉai|eṭṭām vēṟṟumai ~eṉṟal |āṇṭuk kaṭāva+-paṭā.

<P>((25)) ``pal poruṭku* ēṟpiṉ nallatu kōṭal'' -āvatu -- |orucūttiram pala poruṭku* ēṟkum -āyiṉ |avaṟṟuḷ nallataṉai+ poruḷ-āka+ kōṭal.

<P>((26)) ``tokutta moḻiyāṉ vakuttaṉar kōṭal'' -āvatu -- tokuttu+kūṟiya col taṉṉāṉ -ē piṟitu*-um-oru poruḷ vakuttu+-kāṭṭal.

<P>|atu ``kuṟṟiyal-ukara muṟai+-peyar maruṅkiṉ'' ((moḻimarapu.9))|eṉṉum^ cūttirattāṉ moḻi-mutaṟ kuṟṟukaram -um^ kōṭal.

<P>{colliṉ muṭipiṉ |a+ poruḷ% muṭittal} eṉpatu* -um atu.

<P>((27)) ``maṟutalai citaittu+ taṉ ^tuṇipu* uraittal'' -āvatu --piṟa nūlāciriyaṉ kūṟiṉa poruṇmaiyai+ keṭuttu+ taṉ ^tuṇivukūṟutal.

<P>|aḵtāvatu neṭṭeḻuttu* -ēḻ |aḷapeṭai ~eṉpaṉa kuṟṟeḻuttiṉvikāram eṉpārai maṟuttu vēṟu* -ōr eḻuttu* -āka ~ōtutal.

<P>((28)) ``piṟaṉkōṭ kūṟal'' -āvatu -- piṟa nūlāciriyaṉ koṇṭakōṭpāṭṭai+ kūṟutal.

<P>|atu ``vēṟṟumai tāmē yēḻ eṉa moḻipa'' ((vēṟṟumaiyiyal.1.))|eṉṟal.

<P>((29)) ``|aṟiyātu* uṭampaṭal'' -āvatu -- tāṉ aṟiyāta poruḷai+piṟar kūṟiya -~āṟṟāṉ uṭampaṭutal.

<P>|atu {?{|ēḻānarakam}?} |ittaṉmaittu* eṉa ~oruvaṉ kūṟiya -vaḻi|atu pulaṉ -ākātu* -ātaliṉ |avaṉ coṉṉataṟku* uṭampaṭutal. |ituvaḻi-nūl āciriyarkku* urittu.

<P>((30)) ``poruḷ iṭai ~iṭutal'' -āvatu -- |oru poruḷai ~ōtiya-vaḻi ~ataṟku* iṉam ākiya poruḷai+ cēra+ kūṟātu |iṭaiyīṭu-paṭa+kūṟutal.

<P>|atu ``peṇmai cuṭṭiya'' ((peyariyal. 24)) ~eṉṉuñ cūttiram ōti|ataṉ pakuti ~ākiya ``|āṇmai tirinta peyar-nilai+ kiḷavi''~eṉpataṉai |iṭaiyiṭṭu vaittal pōlvaṉa.

<P>((31)) ``|etir-poruḷ uṇarttal'' -āvatu -- |iṉiṉ kūṟavēṇṭuvatu* itu ~eṉa ~uṇarttal.

<P>((32)) ``colliṉ |eccam colliyāṅku* uṇarttal'' eṉpatu --pirinilai mutalāka+ collappaṭṭa |eccaṅkaḷai+ kaṇṭu |āṅku+colliyavāṟṟāṟ poruḷ-kōṭal.

<P>((33)) ``tantu puṇarntu* uraittal'' -āvatu -- muṉ= āyiṉum piṉ=āyiṉum niṉṟa cūttirattiṟ collai |iṭai-niṉṟa cūttirattiṉ -um^koṇarntu puṇarttu* uraittal.

<P>((34)) ``ñāpakam^ kūṟal'' -āvatu -- |iraṭṭuṟa moḻintu |iraṇṭucoṟku* -um poruḷ-kōṭal.

<P>((35)) ``|uyttu+-koṇṭu* uṇartal'' -āvatu -- |oru cūttirattāṉ|or ilakkaṇam |otiya-vaḻi |ataṟku+ poruntāmai ~uḷatāka+ tōṉṟiṉ|ataṟku+ poruntum-āṟu vicārittu* uṇartal.

<P>paṉi ~eṉṉum^ collukku |attu* -um |iṉ= -um^ cāriyai ~ām eṉṟārāyiṉum ((|uyirmayaṅkiyal. 39)) |avaṟṟuḷ |ēṟpatu* oṉṟu* ātaliṉ|iṉ=-īṟṟu* āya-~āṟu varuvaṉa ~uyttu*-uṇartal -ām.

<P>|ivai muppattu*-iraṇṭu* -um tantira-~utti -~āvaṉa.

<P>``meyppaṭa ... nūl'' eṉpatu mēṟ collappaṭṭavaṟṟōṭu kūṭa+poruḷ-paṭa |ārāyntu colliya ~allātaṉa ~ākiya piṟavaṇ variṉum^colliya neṟiyiṉāṟ curuṅka ~ārāyntu maṉattiṉāṉ ōrntu kuṟṟam -aṟa+terintu colliya {?{viṉattōṭu}?} pāku-paṭuttu* uraittal vēṇṭum atunuṇmaitaka+ pulavar kūṟiya nūliṉai ~eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>piṟavāṟu koḷa+-paṭuvaṉa māṭṭu*-eṟitalāṉ, coṟporuḷ virittal`|oṉṟeṉa muṭittal, taṉṉiṉa muṭittal' eṉpaṉa.

<P>|ivaṟṟuḷ, `māṭṭeṟital' -āvatu muṉṉoru poruḷ kūṟi+piṉ-varuvatum |atu pōlum eṉṟal. |aḵtāvatu ``|ukara ~iṟuti |akara~iyaṟṟē'' ((|uyirmayaṅkiyal. 51)) |eṉa varum.

<P>coṟ-poruḷ virittal -āvatu patam^ -tōṟum poruḷ virittu+ kaṭā-~um viṭai -~uṅ kūṟutal.

<P>`|oṉṟeṉa muṭittal taṉṉiṉa muṭittal' eṉpatu colla+-paṭṭa-~āṟṟāṉ {?{varumuttiram}?} -ē -~āka+ tokai+-paṭa muṭiyum |iṉa-~um^ cila ~āciriyar matam pala ~uttikku* um |ēṟkum |oru cūttiram|i+ nūl -akattu* uḷ....poruḷ koṇṭāmāyiṉum |īṇṭu* uraittapākupāṭu* ellāvaṟṟiṟku* -um |i+ nūl -akattu* utāraṇam -ēkaṇṭu-koḷka.

<P>|iṉṉum^ ``colliya -~alla piṟa'' ~eṉṟataṉāṉ yāṟṟu*-oḻukku|arimāṉ*^nōkku tavaḷai+-pāyttuḷ paruntu-viḻukkāṭu* eṉṉum^cūttira+-kiṭakkaiyum |āti-viḷakku mattima-tīpam |iṟuti-viḷakku|eṉṉum poruḷkōḷ* ^nilai -~um^ koḷḷappaṭum.

<P>yāṟṟoḻukku* -āvatu karutiya-poruḷai vaḻuvāmaṟ cūttiram|oruṅku-paṭa+ kiḷattal, |arimāṉ*^nōkku* -āvatu muṉṉum piṉṉuṅkūṟukiṉṟa ~iraṇṭu cūttirattiṉai -~um iṭai-niṉṟa cūttiramnōkkutal.

<P>tavaḷai+-pāyttuḷ -āvatu |iṭaiyaṟuttu*-ōṭutal.

<P>paruntu-viḻukkāṭu* -āvatu |av= atikārattuṭ poruttam illātaporuḷ yātāṉum -oru kāraṇattāl |iṭai-varutal.

<P>{|āti-viḷakku*} -āvatu cūttirattiṉāl |ātiyiṉ |amaitta poruḷ{?{|antattaḷavu mōṭutal}?}.

<P>{mattima-tīpam} -āvatu |iṭai-niṉṟa poruḷ muṉ= -um piṉ= -umnōkkutal. |iṟuti-viḷakku* -āvatu |iṟuti-niṉṟa poruḷ |iṭai -~um*mutal -um* nōkkutal. (112)

<P>((|oṉpatāvatu marapiyal muṟṟiṟṟu.))

<P>((poruḷatikāram mūlamum |uraiyum muṟṟiṟṟu.))



